{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language java, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 216, "char_start": 0, "quote": "Input {\"coeff\": integers [a_d,...,a_0], \"x\": integer}. Return a_d*x^d+...+a_0. Empty coefficient list represents the zero polynomial. Input constraints guarantee a signed 64-bit result and intermediate Horner values.", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 266, "char_start": 228, "quote": "Input:\n{\"coeff\": [], \"x\": 5}\nOutput:\n0", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 317, "char_start": 278, "quote": "Input:\n{\"coeff\": [5], \"x\": 3}\nOutput:\n5", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R5", "source": {"char_end": 377, "char_start": 329, "quote": "Input:\n{\"coeff\": [1, -2, 3], \"x\": -4}\nOutput:\n27", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 3: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R6", "source": {"char_end": 434, "char_start": 389, "quote": "Input:\n{\"coeff\": [0, 0, 9], \"x\": 0}\nOutput:\n9", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 4: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input."